I have to make it better.

521
00:27:38,356 --> 00:27:40,976
It makes you nervous, doesn't it?

522
00:27:40,976 --> 00:27:42,916
Yes, you're right.

523
00:27:42,916 --> 00:27:44,176
It's so difficult.

524
00:27:44,714 --> 00:27:49,514
Do you remember when I called you a really long time ago, Sakura?

525
00:27:49,514 --> 00:27:54,214
We talked about the future.

526
00:27:54,214 --> 00:27:55,954
It was a long time ago.

527
00:27:55,954 --> 00:27:58,954
I know it's been years, but...

528
00:27:58,954 --> 00:28:04,674
It seems like only yesterday.

529
00:28:04,674 --> 00:28:07,714
From now on...

530
00:28:07,714 --> 00:28:11,214
I'm going to take a different path from now on.

531
00:28:11,226 --> 00:28:14,466
I'll always love you and I'll always support you

532
00:28:14,466 --> 00:28:20,046
And I'll support you the most.

533
00:28:20,046 --> 00:28:25,926
Let's have dinner together again

534
00:28:25,926 --> 00:28:29,386
Let's go out to dinner together again, eat meat and have a lot of fun!

535
00:28:29,386 --> 00:28:34,226
I really, really love you!

536
00:28:34,226 --> 00:28:35,326
Thank you Sakura!

537
00:28:41,226 --> 00:28:54,741
See you soon!
